{
  "title": "Quick Brazilian Cheese Toast",
  "description": "A rich and energizing Brazilian dish featuring yuzu and cheese, perfect for a snack or light meal, with anti-inflammatory friendly ingredients. This recipe is made in a fondue pot for a fun and interactive experience.",
  "cuisine": "Brazilian",
  "diet": [
